pi.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5436837877","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119460#issuecomment-5436837877","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119460","id":5436837877,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRA-P9Q","user":{"login":"MusouCrow","id":12614296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNjE0Mjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12614296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MusouCrow","html_url":"https://github.com/MusouCrow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MusouCrow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MusouCrow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MusouCrow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MusouCrow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MusouCrow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MusouCrow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MusouCrow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MusouCrow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MusouCrow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-27T09:07:25Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T09:07:25Z","body":"I've been testing this PR in a visual novel project and noticed a small issue with the current ruby text layout.\r\n\r\nThe spacing between the ruby text and the base text is currently fixed at 2px. Depending on the font and font size, this can result in the ruby text appearing somewhat too close to the base text.\r\n\r\nI've attached a screenshot to illustrate the issue. I thought it might be worth mentioning as part of the ruby text implementation.\r\n\r\nThank you for working on this feature. It has been quite useful for Japanese text in my testing.\r\n<img width=\"519\" height=\"135\" alt=\"图片\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0c9b47f8-3a3a-4009-a141-b1ec9c9da05f\" />","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5436837877/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5528472587","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119460#issuecomment-5528472587","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119460","id":5528472587,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSYXMCw","user":{"login":"Zemeio","id":49595821,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NTk1ODIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49595821?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zemeio","html_url":"https://github.com/Zemeio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zemeio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zemeio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zemeio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zemeio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zemeio/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zemeio/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zemeio/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zemeio/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zemeio/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-03T16:02:20Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T16:02:20Z","body":"> I've been testing this PR in a visual novel project and noticed a small issue with the current ruby text layout.\r\n> \r\n> The spacing between the ruby text and the base text is currently fixed at 2px. Depending on the font and font size, this can result in the ruby text appearing somewhat too close to the base text.\r\n> \r\n> I've attached a screenshot to illustrate the issue. I thought it might be worth mentioning as part of the ruby text implementation.\r\n> \r\n> Thank you for working on this feature. It has been quite useful for Japanese text in my testing. <img alt=\"图片\" width=\"519\" height=\"135\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/12614296/642060789-0c9b47f8-3a3a-4009-a141-b1ec9c9da05f.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..bPdjSe126DiCCjYkCkLw_b_ygSnDNB5TG0IXYPQ_Scg\">\r\n\r\nThank you for pointing that out. As I have wrote this code a few months back it might take me a while to fix, but I will check at my earliest convenience!\r\n\r\nIf you have a few more test cases that I can run, please let me know, and I will try to fix them all in one go.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5528472587/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5537361170","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119460#issuecomment-5537361170","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119460","id":5537361170,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSg1tEg","user":{"login":"Zemeio","id":49595821,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NTk1ODIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49595821?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zemeio","html_url":"https://github.com/Zemeio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zemeio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zemeio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zemeio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zemeio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zemeio/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zemeio/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zemeio/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zemeio/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zemeio/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-04T07:43:33Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T07:43:33Z","body":"@MusouCrow \r\nThank you for the report. I changed the 2 to make a ration of the font size and separated as a constant so that it is easier to change (mostly for my testing). I feel it works well with 0.3, your example now becomes like this with a size of 60.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"622\" height=\"180\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1ae41c4a-1fca-4ddc-b960-672f3478814e\" />\r\n\r\nDo you feel this is ok?\r\nIt is still a little bit different depending on the size, but I think this is good for readability.\r\n\r\nThis is how it looks with a size of 20\r\n<img width=\"539\" height=\"165\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8dd6dc90-e00d-4d3c-b83b-b71d2f516f45\" />\r\n\r\nI tried with a bunch of sizes but they no longer overlapped.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5537361170/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]